window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-037-f5016fdf2fd26c68.json"]={sha256:"f5016fdf2fd26c6891e4986e2e7d5637b5f00ca21527a042b298f7dd446e8f2d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-be4f718fe09216f8","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware","title":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","titleEn":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-037","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-037","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-038","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03318-4"],"title":"Quantinuum QCCD：離子運輸的運動學邊界","titleEn":"Quantinuum QCCD: kinematic bounds on ion transport","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付計數分布、SNR換算及曝光／狀態穩定性取捨。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver count distributions, SNR calculations and exposure/state-stability tradeoffs. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Quantinuum QCCD：離子運輸的運動學邊界』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付位置／速度／加速度圖及到位／加熱雙驗收表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Quantinuum QCCD: kinematic bounds on ion transport', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver position/velocity/acceleration plots and separate arrival/heating acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立Poisson計數的差分SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd)；這不是最佳閾值的精確錯誤概率。 使用教學亮態Nb=25、暗態Nd=1個計數；相同曝光時間。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(25-1)/sqrt(25+1)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：分別列Poisson方差等於均值；若觀測方差大於均值，加入光源波動模型。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：對稱加速／減速三角速度代理，距離L=aT²/4，所以a=4L/T²；不是避免加熱的實際波形。 使用教學L=200 μm、T=100 μs；僅分析運動學與時間預算。 以手算或試算表計算名義式4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：積分三角速度面積應為200 μm；計算v峰=aT/2核對距離。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For independent Poisson counts, difference SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd); this is not the exact optimal-threshold error probability. Use Teaching bright count Nb=25 and dark count Nd=1 at equal exposure. Evaluate nominal expression (25-1)/sqrt(25+1) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: List Poisson variance equal to mean; if observed variance exceeds mean, add illumination-fluctuation modeling.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For a symmetric triangular-velocity proxy, L=aT²/4, so a=4L/T²; it is not a real low-heating transport waveform. Use Teaching L=200 μm and T=100 μs; analyze kinematics and timing only. Evaluate nominal expression 4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Integrate triangular velocity to200 μm; use peak velocity aT/2 to cross-check distance.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-047","referenceUrls":["https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform"],"title":"QuEra 中性原子：熱速度與 Doppler 退相位","titleEn":"QuEra neutral atoms: thermal velocity and Doppler dephasing","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付計數分布、SNR換算及曝光／狀態穩定性取捨。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver count distributions, SNR calculations and exposure/state-stability tradeoffs. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『QuEra 中性原子：熱速度與 Doppler 退相位』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付熱速度、無量綱相位展寬及Doppler／雷射噪聲診斷矩陣。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'QuEra neutral atoms: thermal velocity and Doppler dephasing', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver thermal velocity, dimensionless phase spread and Doppler/laser-noise discrimination.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立Poisson計數的差分SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd)；這不是最佳閾值的精確錯誤概率。 使用教學亮態Nb=25、暗態Nd=1個計數；相同曝光時間。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(25-1)/sqrt(25+1)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：分別列Poisson方差等於均值；若觀測方差大於均值，加入光源波動模型。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：一維熱速度σv=sqrt(kBT/m)，高斯Doppler對比C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]；keff為兩光子有效波向量，非任一單束波數。 使用教學m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg、T=10 μK、keff=10⁶ m⁻¹、t=10 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認keffσvt無量綱；比較−lnC正比T，並將keff=0列作忽略其他噪聲時的理想極限。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For independent Poisson counts, difference SNR=(Nb−Nd)/sqrt(Nb+Nd); this is not the exact optimal-threshold error probability. Use Teaching bright count Nb=25 and dark count Nd=1 at equal exposure. Evaluate nominal expression (25-1)/sqrt(25+1) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: List Poisson variance equal to mean; if observed variance exceeds mean, add illumination-fluctuation modeling.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: One-dimensional σv=sqrt(kBT/m) gives Gaussian Doppler contrast C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]; keff is the effective two-photon wavevector. Use Teaching m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg, T=10 μK, keff=10⁶ m⁻¹ and t=10 μs. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check dimensionless keffσvt; verify−lnC scales with T and use keff=0 as an ideal limit excluding other noise.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-597cb4354f2dd909","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03318-4","title":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","titleEn":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","publisher":"Pino et al., Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-03197d83dc430913","url":"https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform","title":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","titleEn":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","publisher":"QuEra","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
